          "Text": "Cava is garbed in a medical labcoat, rather than a military uniform. He has a gentle smile and a warm gleam in his eyes, though he is rather subdued; there are often more days with the injured and wounded than without. \"Welcome to the Outpost Hope medical bay. If you are in need of medical attention, please proceed to an empty medical bay, and the medical droids will attend to you. Any particular emergency, I will look into.\"",
